Body:
Thanks for looking into this.

Please let me know the correct private channel where I should send the billing details, such as receipt numbers, invoice IDs, card last 4 digits, email addresses, and screenshots.

To avoid any ambiguity, I still need confirmation for these points:

1. all active OpenCode Go subscriptions/customer records linked to my payment method have been cancelled;
2. no future recurring charges will be attempted;
3. the full billing history can be reviewed;
4. duplicate, unauthorized, or unmanaged recurring charges can be refunded.

I will not post sensitive billing information publicly on GitHub.
